-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Free music and sound effects
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The music and sound effects in assets/library/ are dedicated to the public
domain under CC0 1.0 (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/):
free to use, also in monetised videos, with no credit needed. Each has its
licence file beside it, and assets/library/manifest.json lists every file
with its sha256, author and source page. CC0 asks for no credit; these are
named as a thank-you.

  Sound effects      Kenney (https://kenney.nl), from the packs Interface
                     Sounds, UI Audio, Impact Sounds and Digital Audio
                     (kenney.nl/assets), unmodified.
  Music              HoliznaCC0, from the Free Music Archive
                     (https://freemusicarchive.org/music/holiznacc0/): Roof
                     Tops, Bubbles, Doodles, We Drove All Night, Toy Box,
                     Ruby 1, ITS A TRAP and Pantheon. Each is cut to its
                     first 75 seconds or less with a fade out, turned down
                     so every track is about as loud, and encoded as OGG
                     Vorbis; the manifest says so per file.


